-# The form of the Abmeldung erfassen section as a page of its own: the frame the
-# section's body carries is here as well, so a frame request takes the form out
-# of it and a deep link -- or a browser without javascript -- gets the same form
-# as a whole page.

:css
  .content-header h1 {
    display: none;
  }
  #content {
    padding-top: 10px;
  }

#main.row
  = turbo_frame_tag "deregistration_capture" do
    = render 'capture_form'
